This directory is the detector's memory: violations.json (hysteresis), cooldown.json,
trade_lock.json (which prevents the same trigger from executing a trade twice),
llm_counter.json (the weekly LLM call budget), portfolio_snapshot.json (the pre-trade
snapshot that --rollback restores) and pending_notes.md (notes carried to the Saturday
round). These files must persist between runs — which is why they are not gitignored and
the workflow commits them.
